         as opposed to the certificate and the s.63 annexure, which are documents
         *about* a capture and contain neither. Worded so that someone handing a
         case file over can tell which of the three holds the exhibit. -->
    <string name="bundle_action">Export evidence</string>
    <string name="bundle_generating">Building bundle…</string>
    <string name="bundle_saved">Evidence bundle saved.</string>

